    "text": "15 hours ago The Carthage Board of Commissioners met Tuesday to discuss a broad agenda of topics, ranging from a planned traffic circle at a busy intersection to new development proposals. The board received a brief update on a planned N.C. Department of Transportation project to replace a four-way stop at N.C. 22 and McCaskill Road with a traffic circle. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
